  "description": "Posting a stock transfer step (posting rules §5.4, INV-04, W1-18): per line, out of its from location and into its to location at the item's current average (no cost known: at 0), the average and the quantity on hand unchanged. No journal: every location is the same Inventory account. The same function posts a transfer that moves at once (from → to), its sending (from → In transit) and its receiving (In transit → to, what arrived). Stock below 0 at the from location is flagged negative_stock, never refused (INV-03).",
